      "description": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> An adjacent foe moves away.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> Lord Nar may move up to his speed but must end his move as close to the triggering creature as possible without entering the triggering creature's square.</p>",
